        "title": "Set up the integral",
        "text": "The circle is traced once as \u03b8 goes from $$0$$ to $$\\pi$$ so the area is $$A=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}**{\\pi}36\\sin**2\\theta\\,d\\theta$$",
