        "title": "Evaluate",
        "text": "Use $$sin^2\\left(\\theta\\right)=\\frac{1-cos\\left(2\\theta\\right)}{2}$$. Then $$A=9\\int_{0}**{\\pi}(1-\\cos2\\theta)\\,d\\theta=9\\pi$$",
